DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The bbwwnn driver provides support for Broadcom BCM43xx based PCI/CardBus
     network adapters.

     It supports ssttaattiioonn and mmoonniittoorr mode operation.  Only one virtual inter‐
     face may be configured at any time.  For more information on configuring
     this device, see ifconfig(8).

